{"overview":"Aging rancher and self-made man, George Washington McLintock is forced to deal with numerous personal and professional problems. Seemingly everyone wants a piece of his enormous farmstead, including high-ranking government men and nearby Native Americans. As McLintock tries to juggle his various adversaries, his wife—who left him two years previously—suddenly returns. But she isn't interested in George; she wants custody of their daughter.","tagline":"Never such a tender love story! Never such a savage showdown! Never such restless natives!","cast":[{"n":"John Wayne","c":"George Washington McLintock","p":"/4VmiGmCwSnratHtYmT2AyXrdQ64.jpg","q":"Q40531"},{"n":"Maureen O'Hara","c":"Katherine Gilhooley McLintock","p":"/yGNh18kBF7afOdjTcEP2zFCxzCH.jpg","q":"Q229276"},{"n":"Patrick Wayne","c":"Devlin Warren","p":"/u0EjouQWSjqr5npkGW9EXLNNAnC.jpg","q":"Q2001604"},{"n":"Stefanie Powers","c":"Becky McLintock","p":"/oiTlbv7QC5qaF1BYTY6Qaij5rtq.jpg","q":"Q256474"},{"n":"Jack Kruschen","c":"Jake Birnbaum","p":"/3QOPlFyLfFR8cLe0pseRjrm3lra.jpg","q":"Q1374376"},{"n":"Chill Wills","c":"Drago","p":"/uk1BljEiYkzSd7ihp7SJIpBVI3u.jpg","q":"Q1072969"},{"n":"Yvonne De Carlo","c":"Louise Warren","p":"/cldx7C9iQlVJIdrPWbGlu2HidVW.jpg","q":"Q286339"},{"n":"Jerry Van Dyke","c":"Matt Douglas Jr.","p":"/eNXhtKd9CO65H6OnZHRiVxNeVm4.jpg","q":"Q927631"},{"n":"Edgar Buchanan","c":"Bunny Dull","p":"/zKcqHZrqVsS0N4kdnqaD8vdOINI.jpg","q":"Q950397"},{"n":"Bruce Cabot","c":"Ben Sage","p":"/gWG4ECOOHeQWLEI4nwFlLSFiUpd.jpg","q":"Q373500"}],"country":["United States"],"language":["English"],"wiki":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/McLintock%21","qid":"Q530507","rel":{"AT":{"d":"1964-04-17","c":"12"},"AU":{"d":"2014-03-05","c":"PG"},"BR":{"d":"1963-11-12","c":"12"},"DE":{"d":"1964-03-06","c":"6"},"DK":{"d":"1964-04-06","c":"15"},"FR":{"d":"1964-01-29"},"IT":{"d":"1964-02-28"},"US":{"d":"1963-11-13","c":"NR"}},"backdrops":["/zTLtdaz8kIEQfCZNzQzBx5xNkxt.jpg","/bQMkwm4HanoOqlz9cS8pZMKfB8E.jpg","/kH